flowchart TB
  ALERT[Alert/Mismatch/Operator]-->SCOPE{Scope and subject match}
  SCOPE-->G[Global Kill]
  SCOPE-->U[User Kill]
  SCOPE-->ST[Strategy Kill]
  SCOPE-->PR[Protocol Kill]
  SCOPE-->CH[Chain Kill]
  SCOPE-->EX[Exchange Kill]
  G-->DENY[Common scope-matching deny before sign/submit]
  U-->DENY
  ST-->DENY
  PR-->DENY
  CH-->DENY
  EX-->DENY
  DENY-->IF[Contain in-flight work by policy]
  IF-->AUD[Audit + Incident]
  AUD-->REC[Reconcile / Contain]
  RESET[Authorized reset/revocation]-->SCOPE
